---
GLYPH: B
ENERGY: 2
SPECTRUM: [ts, rs]
---
# Bluebird (Compose)

Composition. Connects the output of one to the input of another.

## Wave Function

@[ts]
```typescript
export const B = <A, B, C>(f: (y: B) => C) => (g: (x: A) => B) => (x: A): C => f(g(x));
```

@[rs]
```rust
pub fn B<A, B, C, F, G>(f: F, g: G) -> impl Fn(A) -> C
where
    F: Fn(B) -> C,
    G: Fn(A) -> B,
{
    move |x| f(g(x))
}
```
